ings us closer to God.","zh":"近来来祷告的人，求的多是白昼长些、夜里平安。我便照教会的教导告诉他们：苦难使人接近神。"}},{"key":"hour:morning","text":{"en":"Morning prayers are just over. If you want holy water, you will have to wait for the deacon; he has the key.","zh":"晨祷刚做完。你若要领圣水，得等执事回来，钥匙在他身上。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The snow on the heights is late melting this year. The sheep still can't get up to the high pasture, so they're on hay.","zh":"山上的雪今年化得晚，羊到现在还上不了高处的草场，只能喂干草。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/vessel/flask/holy_water","id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0.coin5","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk1","type":"actor/person/traveler","name":{"en":"Bernard Vigilrow","zh":"伯纳德·守巷"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.choirby-shrine","x":3,"y":5},"facing":"down","props":{"age":46,"household":"altar.choirby-shrine.h0","purse":3,"favourite":"item/food/fish/catfish"},"contents":["altar.choirby-shrine.folk1.coin0","altar.choirby-shrine.folk1.coin1","altar.choirby-shrine.folk1.coin2"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.swept","face":"face.weary","beard":"beard.moustache","outfit":"outfit.travel","shoes":"shoes.tall"},"colors":{"skin":"tan","hair":"silver","eyes":"storm","outfit.1":"russet","shoes.1":"darkleather"}},"npc":{"role":"traveler","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":5,"map":"altar.choirby-shrine","x":13,"y":9,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":5,"to":12,"map":"altar.choirby-shrine","x":3,"y":5,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"altar.choirby-shrine","x":13,"y":9,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"altar.choirby-shrine","x":3,"y":5,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"altar.choirby-shrine","x":24,"y":14,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello. I haven't seen you before. Are you from out of town?","zh":"你好。没见过你，是外地来的吧？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Six days on the road to get here, and I've worn through my soles. Is there a cobbler round here?","zh":"我走了六天才到这儿，鞋底都磨穿了。这附近有补鞋的吗？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The Church named me for the pilgrimage. They say it is calling people everywhere; of every ten I meet on the road, three or four are on the same errand.","zh":"教会点了我的名，叫我去朝圣。听说各地都在召人，路上碰见的十个人里，倒有三四个跟我一样。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The snow on the heights is late melting this year. The sheep still can't get up to the high pasture, so they're on hay.","zh":"山上的雪今年化得晚，羊到现在还上不了高处的草场，只能喂干草。"}}]}}},{"id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk1.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk1.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk1"}},{"id":"altar.choirby-shrine.folk1.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place"